<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><p>This site sets no analytics, profiling or advertising cookies. It is a static site; nothing on it needs to remember you between visits.</p>
<div class="grid grid--2 point-grid">
<div><h2 class="section-title">Cookies you may still receive</h2><p>Cloudflare may set a strictly necessary cookie (cf_clearance / __cf_bm) for security and bot mitigation. These are exempt from consent under Art. 5(3) of the ePrivacy Directive as strictly necessary for a service you requested.</p></div>
<div><h3>Third-party content</h3><p>Web fonts are self-hosted in this repository (IBM Plex Sans). No request is made to Google Fonts or any other third-party font service.</p></div>
<div><h3>Your control</h3><p>Any browser lets you block or delete cookies; blocking strictly necessary ones may prevent the site from loading.</p></div>
<div><h3>Last updated</h3><p>31 August 2026</p></div>
</div></div></section>
